  "body": "Closes #120\nCloses #125\nCloses #126\nCloses #129\nCloses #266\nCloses #278\nCloses #283\nCloses #353\nCloses #529\nRefs #131 (left: the reply composer of a topic where the account may not post, e.g. an Achats & Ventes topic; R131b is the A&V new-topic composer)\nRefs #337 (capture backlog; not found this batch: #287 #288 #289 #274 #123 #277; skipped: #290, needs user1 or a profile write)\nClaim: mac/M1\nAuthor model: Claude Opus 5.5 (mac/M1-capA-opus)\nReviewer model: Fable 5.1 (mac/M1.review.captures-a)\n\n### What\nCapture batch A of the #337 backlog, 2026-11-18: read-only GETs (anonymous or the user2 capture account; one login POST; never user1; 20 s apart; 28 requests). 17 captures published with `publish.py` (fragment `corpus.d/337-batch-a-20261118.json`), MANIFEST rows (including the not-found states), HFR-PROTOCOL §6c « Batch A read-only captures » with B2 and E2 settled and B11 answered for `quote_only`.\n\nHighlights: `R120a` the MP-unread header link; `R125a` the only home row without `id=\"cat<N>\"` is the MP row (the full sub-forum lists are R285a-c / R929a-d); `R126a` `quote_only=1`; `R129a/b` HFR does not preselect a sub-category; `R278a/c/d` logged-in paging (301 to `liste_sujet-N.htm`, `?page=` ignored); `R283a/b` stale cookies and `unlog.php` deleting them; `R353a/b` two consecutive anonymous pages with an `hfr-rehost.net` image (#266); `R529a-c` member-only category answers.\n\n### Checks\n- `anonymize.py check --corpus`: 771/771 clean; fixture tests 399 OK, manifest agrees; pre-commit.\n- Leak checks: the author's own script (0 hits over 364 names, 29 ids, tokens) and Fable's independent harvest (968 names, 165 ids, MP ids, cookies, e-mails, IPs: none survives). The real id of user2's MP thread stays in 4 private-list files, as in R13a and every private page (FIXTURES.md, Fable round 1 finding 3).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CFeNfBA416G5kNZLfw\n",
