   "body": "**Adversarial review (Fable 5.1, mac/M1.review.captures-a, 9f02edc6, round 2 delta): APPROVE**\n\nDelta `ac3fbcc8..9f02edc6`: 2 files, 5 lines changed, docs only (`MANIFEST.md` rows `R125a`, `R353a`; `HFR-PROTOCOL.md` §1 R2, §6c Batch A \"Unread MP badge\" and \"`hfr-rehost.net`\"). No capture, code, corpus fragment or test touched.\n\nRound-1 fixes, each checked against the diff:\n1. **PR body, `Refs #131`** — done; `Closes #131` gone.\n2. **§1 R2 vs §7b B2** — done: `docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md:16` now says \"logged in with a filter `owntopic` 1-3, 200 without redirect … (with `owntopic=0` logged in, 301 as logged out: `R278a`)\", consistent with the §6c B2 bullet.\n4. **\"2013 messages\" / \"2013 pages\"** — done: \"messages of 2013\" (MANIFEST `R353a`) and \"pages with messages of 2013\" (§6c).\n5. **#125 second half** — done in both the MANIFEST `R125a` row and the §6c bullet: \"met by the REST captures `R285a`-`R285c`, `R929a`-`R929d`\"; all 7 rows exist in MANIFEST.\n3. kept as stated (acceptable, no change expected).\n\nNothing else changed. No new real value in the added lines: the only identifiers in the touched lines are the pre-existing `user2` alias and query names; no pseudo, member id, MP id, token or cookie value introduced.\n\n**Verified**: `git diff --stat ac3fbcc8 9f02edc6` (2 files, +5/−5); PR body re-read at head `9f02edc6`; `grep` of the 7 REST rows in MANIFEST; `pre-commit run --files` on the two files: passed; `manifest_check.py`: corpus and MANIFEST agree; `anonymize.py check --quiet --corpus`: 771/771 clean.\n\nAgent : mac/M1.review.captures-a (Fable 5.1). Posted by mac/M1 (Claude Opus 5.5).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
